        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've got one job: combine as many balls as you can inside the confines of the container.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack too high or spill some over the edge and it's all over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching two balls of the same type will convert them into one ball of the next tier; the higher the tier, the more points you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you can get a ball of the highest tier? .....What about <i><strong>two</strong></i> of them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sports</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the <i>Ball Launcher</i>. Hold down the 'drop' button to charge up power and send the balls soarin'. (Beware of bouncing balls to the stratosphere...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with Ping Pong Balls flying everywhere and end with Beach Balls getting pummeled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls have individualized weights, so be careful! An 8-Ball has a bit more <i>oomph</i> to it than a larger Tennis Ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bubble Ball! in Spaaace!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things will be floaty in this Low Gravity environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to get <i>Mad</i> while combining planets until you create the <i>Sun</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubbles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the sea, not all bubbles are your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the adorable sea creatures are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juuust be careful of those pesky bubble hazards pushing your stuff around...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your favorite settings:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls  - Sports, Planets, or Bubbles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight  - Uniform or Individualized</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball Dropper  - Normal or Launcher </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity - Normal or Low</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hazard - None or Bubbles</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've got one job: combine as many balls as you can inside the confines of the container.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack too high or spill some over the edge and it's all over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching two balls of the same type will convert them into one ball of the next tier; the higher the tier, the more points you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you can get a ball of the highest tier? .....What about <i><strong>two</strong></i> of them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sports</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the <i>Ball Launcher</i>. Hold down the 'drop' button to charge up power and send the balls soarin'. (Beware of bouncing balls to the stratosphere...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with Ping Pong Balls flying everywhere and end with Beach Balls getting pummeled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls have individualized weights, so be careful! An 8-Ball has a bit more <i>oomph</i> to it than a larger Tennis Ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bubble Ball! in Spaaace!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things will be floaty in this Low Gravity environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to get <i>Mad</i> while combining planets until you create the <i>Sun</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubbles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the sea, not all bubbles are your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the adorable sea creatures are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juuust be careful of those pesky bubble hazards pushing your stuff around...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your favorite settings:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls  - Sports, Planets, or Bubbles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight  - Uniform or Individualized</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball Dropper  - Normal or Launcher </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity - Normal or Low</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hazard - None or Bubbles</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Combine balls of the same type to create bigger balls and earn as many points as possible without filling up the container in this cheery, casual puzzle game! Each level has it's own, unique attributes... think you've got what it takes to beat 'em all?",
